  "utterances": [
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 0.4,
      "end": 2.85,
      "text": "Quenby Dental Studio, this is Hana."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 3.83,
      "end": 11.56,
      "text": "Hi Hana, it's Sam from Vantrellis. I saw your team finished the Harlow Street job last week. How did that land?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 12.05,
      "end": 17.0,
      "text": "Ha, it was a sprint, but we got there. Thanks for asking."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 17.59,
      "end": 22.72,
      "text": "Today I'll walk you through how we work and then show you the product."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 23.65,
      "end": 24.02,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 24.71,
      "end": 28.36,
      "text": "Walk me through what filling last-minute cancellations looks like today?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 29.27,
      "end": 37.56,
      "text": "Honestly it's a spreadsheet. Our front desk lead spends two or three hours a day on the phone on it."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 38.65,
      "end": 40.82,
      "text": "What makes that the hardest part?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 41.21,
      "end": 46.99,
      "text": "Things change after it's done. Last time, we had eleven empty slots last Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 47.38,
      "end": 51.78,
      "text": "And when that happens, what does it look like for you personally?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 52.36,
      "end": 58.56,
      "text": "I'm the one on the phone apologizing. It's the part of the job I hate."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 59.55,
      "end": 64.31,
      "text": "If nothing changes over the next six months, what does that cost you?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 64.66,
      "end": 71.28,
      "text": "Honestly? Roughly four thousand dollars a week in empty chairs. And people are tired of it."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 71.71,
      "end": 75.73,
      "text": "What are you hoping a new tool would do for you?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 76.46,
      "end": 78.5,
      "text": "Just make it easier, really."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 79.23,
      "end": 96.95,
      "text": "You said our front desk lead spends two or three hours a day on the phone on filling last-minute cancellations. With us, open slots go out to the waitlist by text automatically. That's the part that would have caught it when we had eleven empty slots last Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 97.38,
      "end": 101.5,
      "text": "Right, and the thing that worries me is whether my"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 102.61,
      "end": 106.26,
      "text": "Right, right, so that's exactly what our dispatch module handles."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 106.87,
      "end": 109.74,
      "text": "Okay. What does something like that cost?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 110.51,
      "end": 114.53,
      "text": "For a team your size it's thirty-six thousand dollars a year."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 118.98,
      "end": 121.85,
      "text": "Hmm. That's more than we budgeted for."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 122.85,
      "end": 125.02,
      "text": "What were you comparing it to?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 126.1,
      "end": 131.89,
      "text": "I guess I was thinking of the cost of the spreadsheet, which is nothing."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 132.25,
      "end": 139.6,
      "text": "Fair. Earlier you mentioned roughly four thousand dollars a week in empty chairs. How does the price compare to that?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 140.62,
      "end": 144.32,
      "text": "When you put it that way, it's not crazy."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 145.17,
      "end": 148.83,
      "text": "Are you the one who makes the call on this?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 149.51,
      "end": 151.12,
      "text": "Me and Dana, mostly."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 152.01,
      "end": 156.04,
      "text": "Does what you've seen so far make sense for your team?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 156.81,
      "end": 161.76,
      "text": "Can you just send me some info and I'll look it over?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 162.49,
      "end": 166.14,
      "text": "Sure, I'll send over our deck and a case study."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 166.9,
      "end": 167.27,
      "text": "Great."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 167.93,
      "end": 169.73,
      "text": "Let's reconnect sometime next week."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 170.53,
      "end": 171.73,
      "text": "Sure, sounds good."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_2",
      "role": "REP",
      "start": 172.15,
      "end": 174.32,
      "text": "Thanks Hana, really appreciate the time."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "spk_1",
      "role": "PROSPECT",
      "start": 174.98,
      "end": 175.77,
      "text": "Thanks, bye."
    }
